PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: MPMCALLA

   1   0000 /*
   2   0000 *******************************************************
   3   0000 *    Direct MP/M Operating System Call Test Program   *
   4   0000 *******************************************************
   5   0000 
   6   0000 The programs MPMCALLA.PLI and MPMCALLB.PLI demonstrate direct MP/M 
   7   0000 Operating System calls from PLI.  The following instructions describe
   8   0000 the steps to assemble, compile, link and execute these programs.
   9   0000 
  10   0000    1)  Compile the PLI programs with the commands:
  11   0000 
  12   0000        A>pli mpmcalla $pl
  13   0000        A>pli mpmcallb $pl
  14   0000 
  15   0000    2)  Assemble the mpmdio.asm module with the command:
  16   0000 
  17   0000        A>rmac mpmdio
  18   0000 
  19   0000    3)  Link the mpmcalla, mpmcallb, and mpmdio modules:
  20   0000 
  21   0000        A>link mpmcalla,mpmcallb,mpmdio
  22   0000 
  23   0000    4)  Gensys your MP/M system as follows:
  24   0000 
  25   0000        Top .... = ff
  26   0000        Number of con..  = 1
  27   0000        Add system call ...  ? n
  28   0000        Bank switched mem... ? n
  29   0000         :0
  30   0000         :a0
  31   0000         :ff
  32   0000 
  33   0000    5)  Run the program:
  34   0000 
  35   0000        A>mpmcalla
  36   0000 
  37   0000 
  38   0000 */
  39   0000 
